    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30856" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Neuri</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Neuroe</span></b> ), ōrum, m., =
